    "安全气囊ECU负责碰撞检测与气囊点火控制，是汽车被动安全系统的核心。永铭LK系列引线型与VKO系列贴片型铝电解电容，专为安全气囊ECU的备用电源、MCU监控、点火驱动及通信回路设计，全系列通过AEC-Q200认证，具备极低漏电流和卓越的低温启动性能，确保在-40℃极端条件下仍能即时激活系统。": "The airbag ECU is responsible for collision detection and airbag ignition control, and is the core of the vehicle's passive safety system. Yongming LK series lead type and VKO series chip type aluminum electrolytic capacitors are specially designed for the backup power supply, MCU monitoring, ignition drive and communication circuit of airbag ECUs. The entire series has passed AEC-Q200 certification and has extremely low leakage current and excellent low-temperature starting performance, ensuring that the system can still be activated immediately under extreme conditions of -40°C.",
    "安全气囊系统通过传感器检测碰撞信号，由ECU判断并触发点火回路，在毫秒级时间内完成气囊充气。永铭电容在其中承担备用电源储能、电源滤波及点火能量供给等关键角色。": "The airbag system detects the collision signal through the sensor, and the ECU determines and triggers the ignition circuit, completing the airbag inflation within milliseconds. Yongming capacitors play key roles in backup power storage, power filtering and ignition energy supply.",
    "备用电源": "Backup power",
    "在碰撞断电瞬间提供备用能量，确保ECU持续工作。需大容量、低漏电流电容，防止长期搁置后容量衰减影响系统激活。": "Provide backup energy at the moment of power outage in a collision to ensure that the ECU continues to work. A large-capacity, low-leakage current capacitor is required to prevent capacity degradation from affecting system activation after long-term storage.",
    "MCU监控回路": "MCU monitoring loop",
    "负责传感器信号采集与碰撞算法判定，对电源纹波敏感，需要低ESR电容保证供电稳定性。": "Responsible for sensor signal acquisition and collision algorithm determination, it is sensitive to power supply ripple and requires low ESR capacitors to ensure power supply stability.",
    "点火驱动回路": "Ignition drive circuit",
    "在ECU发出点火指令后，瞬时释放大电流引爆气囊。电容需具备高纹波电流能力和极低内阻。": "After the ECU issues an ignition command, it instantly releases a large current to detonate the airbag. The capacitor needs to have high ripple current capability and very low internal resistance.",
    "通信回路": "communication loop",
    "与其他ECU（如ABS、ESC）交换车辆状态信息，需要滤波电容抑制总线噪声，确保通信可靠性。": "To exchange vehicle status information with other ECUs (such as ABS, ESC), filter capacitors are required to suppress bus noise and ensure communication reliability.",
    "备用电源储能电容": "Backup power storage capacitor",
    "点火驱动电容": "Ignition drive capacitor",
    "通信回路滤波": "Communication loop filtering",
    "电池输入": "battery input",
    "气囊点火器": "air bag igniter",
    "▲ 蓝色节点为关键电容功能块，红色为执行器": "▲ The blue node is the key capacitor function block, and the red node is the actuator",
    "每个拓扑节点对应的电容推荐系列与典型料号，点击料号可进入产品详情页。": "Recommended capacitor series and typical material numbers corresponding to each topological node. Click on the material number to enter the product details page.",
    "拓扑节点\tRecommended Series\t典型料号\tKey Parameters": "Topology node Recommended Series Typical material number Key Parameters",
    "备用电源储能\tLK (Radial)\tOLKC1101C271MF\t270µF, 16V, 105℃, 6000h": "Backup power storage LK (Radial) OLKC1101C271MF 270µF, 16V, 105℃, 6000h",
    "点火驱动\tLK (Radial)\tOLKC1202G4R7MF\t4.7µF, 400V, 105℃, 6000h": "Ignition driver LK (Radial) OLKC1202G4R7MF 4.7µF, 400V, 105℃, 6000h",
    "通信回路滤波\tVKO (SMD)\tVKOD1001C271MV\t270µF, 16V, 105℃, 8000h": "Communication loop filter VKO (SMD) VKOD1001C271MV 270µF, 16V, 105℃, 8000h",
    "专为备用电源与点火驱动回路设计，具备极低漏电流（≤20μA）和优异的低温放电特性，-40℃仍可稳定输出。对标NCC LBV/LBG系列，已通过AEC-Q200认证。": "Specially designed for backup power supply and ignition drive circuit, it has extremely low leakage current (≤20μA) and excellent low-temperature discharge characteristics, and can still output stably at -40℃. Comparing with NCC LBV/LBG series, it has passed AEC-Q200 certification.",
    "料号\tVoltage\tCapacitance\t温度\tLife": "Material No. Voltage Capacitance Temperature Life",
    "SMD封装，适配自动化产线，用于MCU电源滤波及通信回路。3300μF大容量设计满足备用电源需求，8000小时长寿命保障全生命周期可靠性。": "SMD package, suitable for automated production lines, used for MCU power filtering and communication loops. The 3300μF large-capacity design meets the backup power supply needs, and the 8000-hour long life ensures full life cycle reliability.",
    "最小容量损失下降": "Minimum capacity loss drops",
    "LK系列在长期搁置后仍保持极低的漏电流（≤20μA），确保备用电源回路在碰撞瞬间有足够能量激活点火系统。": "The LK series maintains extremely low leakage current (≤20μA) after long-term storage, ensuring that the backup power circuit has enough energy to activate the ignition system at the moment of collision.",
    "-40℃极端条件激活": "Activated under extreme conditions of -40℃",
    "经实测验证，LK系列电容在-40℃超低温环境下仍能提供稳定的放电电流，确保安全气囊在极寒地区可靠工作。": "It has been verified by actual measurements that the LK series capacitors can still provide stable discharge current in an ultra-low temperature environment of -40°C, ensuring that the airbag works reliably in extremely cold areas.",
    "对标国际品牌": "Benchmarking international brands",
    "LK系列对标NCC GPD系列，VKO系列对标NCC LBV/LBG系列，关键参数相当，已成功完成替代导入与批量生产。": "The LK series is benchmarked against the NCC GPD series, and the VKO series is benchmarked against the NCC LBV/LBG series. The key parameters are equivalent, and replacement import and mass production have been successfully completed.",
